PN,30401
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786843096
OL,3,CPM urged to stick to spirit of Labour
OL,4,Cmanifesto and reject Jackdaw and
OL,5,CRosebank
OL,7,FAndy Burnham has been urged to "stick
OL,8,Fto the spirit of Labour's manifesto
OL,9,Fcommitment" and refuse consent for the
OL,10,Fcontroversial Jackdaw and Rosebank oil
OL,11,Fand gas fields.
OL,13,FStop Climate Chaos Scotland (SCCS) ` a
OL,14,Fcampaign group made up of more than 70
OL,15,Fdifferent organisations with around
OL,16,Fone million supporters ` insisted the
OL,17,Fnew Prime Minister must block the
OL,18,Fproposed new developments in the North
OL,19,FSea.
OL,26,@oD@`OUqD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786843096
OL,3,CPM urged to stick to spirit of Labour
OL,4,Cmanifesto and reject Jackdaw and
OL,5,CRosebank
OL,7,FIt told the Prime Minister that the
OL,8,Flifetime carbon emissions from the two
OL,9,Fproposed developments could result in
OL,10,Fup to 65,495 excess heat deaths by the
OL,11,Fend of this century ` adding this
OL,12,Fwould be equivalent to the entire
OL,13,Fpopulation of the city of Inverness.
OL,15,FA letter to Mr Burnham told how
OL,16,Fanalysts have already linked the
OL,17,Fheatwaves in May and June this year to
OL,18,Fmore than 2,700 excess deaths in
OL,19,FEngland and Wales.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786843096
OL,3,CPM urged to stick to spirit of Labour
OL,4,Cmanifesto and reject Jackdaw and
OL,5,CRosebank
OL,7,FSCCS added that Scotland also
OL,8,Fexperienced a "devastating wildfire"
OL,9,Fin the Cairngorms National Park this
OL,10,Fsummer which "required a major and
OL,11,Fsustained emergency response"
OL,13,FThe plea comes ahead of the public
OL,14,Fconsultation on Rosebank ` the largest
OL,15,Funtapped oil field in the North Sea
OL,16,Fwhich lies some 80 miles north west of
OL,17,FShetland ` closing on Monday.
OL,26,@pD@OOUpD@dO]rD@NOUsD@]O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786843096
OL,3,CPM urged to stick to spirit of Labour
OL,4,Cmanifesto and reject Jackdaw and
OL,5,CRosebank
OL,7,FA similar exercise for the planned
OL,8,FJackdaw gas field, which lies in
OL,9,Fwaters about 150 miles east of
OL,10,FAberdeen, finished on August 10.
OL,12,FProduction at both fields had been
OL,13,Fapproved by the previous Conservative
OL,14,Fgovernment, but those decisions were
OL,15,Fquashed after a legal challenge from
OL,16,FGreenpeace, leaving Labour ministers
OL,17,Fto decide now whether or not drilling
OL,18,Fshould go ahead.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786843096
OL,3,CPM urged to stick to spirit of Labour
OL,4,Cmanifesto and reject Jackdaw and
OL,5,CRosebank
OL,7,FIt comes as the Met Office said it is
OL,8,F"increasingly likely" that 2026 will
OL,9,Fthe UK's hottest ever summer, leaving
OL,10,Fall of Wales and much of England
OL,11,Ffacing drought conditions.
OL,13,FIn a letter seen by the Press
OL,14,FAssociation and sent to both the Prime
OL,15,FMinister and Energy Secretary Miatta
OL,16,FFahnbulleh, SCCS warned that the
OL,17,F"consequences of climate change are
OL,18,Falready being felt, through more
OL,19,Fextreme heat, drought, wildfires and
OL,20,Fgrowing risks to food insecurity".
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@UO]yD@AOU|D@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786843096
OL,3,CPM urged to stick to spirit of Labour
OL,4,Cmanifesto and reject Jackdaw and
OL,5,CRosebank
OL,7,FThey were told that approving Jackdaw
OL,8,Fand Rosebank would have "consequences
OL,9,Ffor the UK's international climate
OL,10,Fleadership".
OL,12,FWhile the campaigners said the UK had
OL,13,F"made progress in reducing emissions",
OL,14,Fthey warned that "credibility will be
OL,15,Fundermined" if new developments in the
OL,16,FNorth Sea are given the go ahead.
OL,18,F"It becomes much harder for the UK to
OL,19,Fask others to move away from fossil
OL,20,Ffuels if it continues approving major
OL,21,Fnew fields at home," the letter added.
OL,26,@pD@YOUrD@KO]uD@AOUuD@eO]vD@ROUwD@KO]zD@
OL,26,AAOU}D@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786843096
OL,3,CPM urged to stick to spirit of Labour
OL,4,Cmanifesto and reject Jackdaw and
OL,5,CRosebank
OL,7,FSigned by groups including Friends of
OL,8,Fthe Earth Scotland, the Environmental
OL,9,FRights Centre Scotland and Fuel
OL,10,FPoverty Action, it insisted:
OL,11,F"Approving Rosebank and Jackdaw does
OL,12,Fnot lower energy bills for UK
OL,13,Fhouseholds, nor does it future-proof
OL,14,Femployment in the energy sector.
OL,26,@sD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786843096
OL,3,CPM urged to stick to spirit of Labour
OL,4,Cmanifesto and reject Jackdaw and
OL,5,CRosebank
OL,7,F"By contrast, investing in clean, home-
OL,8,Fgrown renewable energy can strengthen
OL,9,Fenergy security while creating secure,
OL,10,Flong-term jobs that benefit
OL,11,Findividuals and communities and are
OL,12,Fnot dependent on the volatility of
OL,13,Fglobal fossil fuel markets."
OL,15,FThe letter claimed that approving new
OL,16,Ffields such as Rosebank and Jackdaw is
OL,17,F"not compatible with climate goals".
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@\O]yD@AOUyD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786843096
OL,3,CPM urged to stick to spirit of Labour
OL,4,Cmanifesto and reject Jackdaw and
OL,5,CRosebank
OL,7,FIt continued: "Oxfam estimates that
OL,8,FRosebank and Jackdaw's combined
OL,9,Flifetime carbon emissions could cause
OL,10,Fup to 65,495 excess heat deaths by
OL,11,F2100, a toll equivalent to the entire
OL,12,Fpopulation of Inverness."
OL,14,FSCCS urged the PM to reject both
OL,15,FJackdaw and Rosebank and "make this a
OL,16,Fdecisive moment to accelerate
OL,17,Finvestment in home energy efficiency,
OL,18,Frenewables and clean energy
OL,19,Fmanufacturing".
OL,26,@oD@OOUtD@YO]wD@ZOU{D@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786843096
OL,3,CPM urged to stick to spirit of Labour
OL,4,Cmanifesto and reject Jackdaw and
OL,5,CRosebank
OL,7,FA spokesperson for the Department of
OL,8,FEnergy Security and Net Zero said:
OL,9,F"The North Sea remains a vital
OL,10,Fnational asset, supporting jobs,
OL,11,Fgrowth and the UK's energy security.
OL,13,F"We are clear that oil and gas will
OL,14,Fcontinue to play an important role in
OL,15,Four energy system for decades to come,
OL,16,Falongside transitioning to clean power
OL,17,Fto protect jobs and tackle the climate
OL,18,Fcrisis."
OL,26,@qD@AOUuD@AOUzD@HO]
